tests/fixtures/engine/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.json
=============================================

This file is a verbatim, unmodified copy of
.cortex/acp-migration/T002/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.json, vendored here because
.cortex/ is gitignored (see .gitignore) and therefore not guaranteed present
in a fresh checkout/clone or CI. It is copied so that
tests/test_portable_engine_contract.py's cross-check of EngineCapability
against the recorded capability matrix always runs (never skips) regardless
of whether the historical .cortex evidence tree happens to be present
locally.

If the gitignored .cortex source file is also present, the test additionally
asserts it is byte-identical to this vendored copy, as a drift check.

Do not hand-edit this file; if T002's capability matrix changes, re-copy it
from .cortex/acp-migration/T002/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.json verbatim.
